{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[9],"Id":54,"TextResource":{"Name":"gatsby","Translations":[{"Text":"Gatsby","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Gatsby","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":37},{"FloorId":"3","Id":62},{"FloorId":"4","Id":259}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Con presencia en todos los rincones del aeropuerto, Gatsby ofrece gran variedad de s\u00e1ndwiches y ensaladas, coronado con un excelente buffet que complace los gustos de toda la familia. Adem\u00e1s, su cafeter\u00eda de nivel te brinda un espacio de calma en cada visita.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>With a presence in every corner of the airport, Gatsby offers a variety of sandwiches and salads, crowned by an excellent buffet that pleases all tastes in the family. Its high-level coffee shop also offers you a peaceful atmosphere every time you visit.\u00a0<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1489712604","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/054_gatsby.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/367\/node\/325","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/367\/node\/325","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/054_gatsby.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/54\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/054_gatsby.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/54\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_restaurant_opening_hours"},{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_restaurant_phone"},{"key":"field_website","label":"Website","field_name":"field_res